{"title":"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Kinda_Cheese)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Kinda Cheese)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/b/6ebabe6f737db7a0f7825d4a0f4023d395532098.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 , a_2 , ...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"64\" height=\"11\" /> be a sequence for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/a/0bad78c0b52d180bb51ac7f3f167374b4d38a73b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/c/ffce335a846c1048a9d985eb07371ffc96eaf752.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/8/588fa958248d3d4f2963cf6110f8f99d7ad7ef4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n=\\frac{a_{n-1}}{a_{n-2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"81\" height=\"35\" /> for each positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/1/8f1e2533d6abdb11a9a1626c0240fab1a9200fc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/0/b5033830f7a46e393b1f2c6cba9de59d64a7a87b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2006}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/7/cd7bd183afdd316bad13ba5564c7a58ebcec1344.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } \\frac{1}{2}\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } \\frac{2}{3}\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } \\frac{3}{2}\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 2\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"354\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Kinda_Cheese.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Kinda_Cheese)\">Solution 1 (Kinda Cheese)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Kinda Cheese)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Looking at the first few terms of the sequence:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/3/2137c56db5ae36da103beb38ea3975020c9dacc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=2 , a_2=3 , a_3=\\frac{3}{2}, a_4=\\frac{1}{2} , a_5=\\frac{1}{3} , a_6=\\frac{2}{3} , a_7=2 , a_8=3 , ....$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"502\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Clearly, the sequence repeats every 6 terms. \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/f/08f32923ade8881415a4b4d15ed5fdaccd34d655.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006 \\equiv 2\\bmod{6}$\" width=\"123\" height=\"12\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/5/ee5c513747796c173c75fbe6c10dc395088d3fef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2006} = a_2 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"158\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/5/1654e6ff20746e1af64ed2f5ca47c255f1bc0076.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n = \\frac{a_{n-1}}{a_{n-2}} = \\frac{\\frac{a_{n-2}}{a_{n-3}}}{a_{n-2}} = \\frac{1}{a_{n-3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"212\" height=\"48\" /> , so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/c/dbc4238cb6abfe71a79e15e5ba756b58eb8ad19f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n = a_{n-6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" /> and because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/4/4d477a89208efb1026a2da29ab1c4920eff25aa9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006 = 2 + 334 \\times 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"152\" height=\"15\" /> , so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/5/ee5c513747796c173c75fbe6c10dc395088d3fef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2006} = a_2 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"158\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~thatmathsguy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B\">2006 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems